  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mohammad Shadab Abdul Qayyum Khan vs The State Of Maharashtra on 20 January, 2023 Author: M. S. Karnik Bench: M. S. Karnik Darshan Patil 911-aba-190-23.doc In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No. 190 Of 2023 Mohammad Shadab Abdul Qayyum Khan ..Applicant Vs. The State of Maharashtra ..Respondent ------------ Tushar Sonawane a/w Pooja Satpute for the Applicant. Ms. A. A. Takalkar, App for the State. Psi Sanil Patil, Pelhar Police Station ------------ Coram : M. S. Karnik, J. Date : January 20, 2023 P.C. : 1.",
    "facts": "The applicant is apprehending arrest in connection with C.R. No. 1055 of 2022 registered with Pelhar Police Station, for the offence punishable under sections 188, 273, 328, 34 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 with under sections 26(2)(iv) and 30(2)(a) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. Gutkha, pan masala and scented supari was found in the possession of the co-accused which is worth Darshan Patil 911-aba-190-23.doc Rs.9,67,495/-. On the basis of the statement of the co- accused, the applicant is implicated. There is nothing recovered from the applicant. There are no criminal antecedents reported against the applicant.",
